---
import Case from "../Case.astro"
import Testimonial from "../Testimonial.astro"
import screenshot from "../../images/samen-op-stap.png"
---

<Case title="Samen op Stap" url="https://samenopstap.app" image={screenshot}>
  <div class="summary">
    <p>
      During the initial months of COVID in the Netherlands, restaurants were
      allowed to stay open, but with strict rules about reservations and health
      checks. I've built an initial React Native prototype for a system to book
      a reservation and check the occupancy rate, to make it easier for
      businesses to comply with these rules.
    </p>
  </div>
  <Testimonial
    author="Sythe Veenje"
    jobTitle="Webdesigner & Developer"
    company="Sythe"
    companyURL="https://sythe.nl"
  >
    <p>
      "Stef built a prototype for us in React Native. He was realistic in
      estimating how much work it takes to build our app. We were very happy
      with Stef!"
    </p>
  </Testimonial>
</Case>
